Hi all,

I've been working with a state file/genind file with my dartseq data so far. I'm trying to use dartR's nice way of converting it through to a "gds" file for use with SNPRelate. However I seem to get the following error that I am unable to resolve.

> teretLD <- gi2gl(dps2, parallel = TRUE)

Error in gi2gl(dps2, parallel = TRUE) :   trying to get slot "loc.n.all" from an object of a basic class ("matrix") with no slots

where "dps2" is my genind file of ~21,000 snps

Thanks in advance!

